  "description": "ZIJTAP crystallizes in the tetragonal crystal system with space group I -4. Reported CIF formula moiety: C64 H108 Ho8 N28 O60. From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 9 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 9 O neighbors; Ho5 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho6 (Ho) has 9 O neighbors; Ho7 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho8 (Ho) has 9 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 10 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.721-3.806 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.50-112.25°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C64H108Ho8N28O60. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 12 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
